# Run outputs must never be committed here.
#
# run_all_scenarios writes a per-scenario results table. On a public repository a
# committed results table is a public download of model output keyed by scenario id.
# It is harmless for the synthetic fixture and would be harmful for anything else, so
# the safe habit is enforced by the file system rather than by remembering.
outputs/
matlab/outputs/

# The golden regression baseline is generated by a run.
#
# The hazard runs FORWARD, not backward: both this repository and the private one use the
# identical relative path tests/golden/regression_golden.csv. A private golden produced from
# real data must never travel into this repository. CI uploads the golden as a build
# artifact instead, where it can be reviewed before anyone commits it anywhere.
tests/golden/
*.slxc
*.asv
